<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - Wesselius repeats ASML a Buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - Wesselius repeats ASML a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of April 18</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>ASM Lithography Technology    148.00  Wesselius Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY (reiterated). In 1996 ASML sold 205 wafer steppers at an average selling price of NLG 6.1 million. For 1997 we expect it to sell 205 again. The average selling price should increase to NLG 7 million, due to a change in the product mix. ASML should also benefit from increased services income as a result of its rapidly-growing installed base. In 1998, it should benefit from the expected recovery in the semiconductor market, leading to a boost in demand for wafer steppers.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS	P/E</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     6.36     n/a</p>
<p>    1997		  6.86    21.6</p>
<p>    1998		  10.20   14.5</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
